# form.ine — a form-style program written with ONLY the current dictionary
# vocabulary. Evidence for PLAN mission 20: no control kinds exist, so this
# shows what a contact form reduces to.
#
# Field kinds (input, textarea, select, checkbox, radio, label, field,
# form) are absent from the dictionary; the only control is `button`, and
# buttons live inside sections.

make page
page title "Contact"

make section
section title "Get in touch"
section inside page

# Closest reachable approximation: a section with a submit-style button.
# There is no field to attach the button to and no way to collect input.
make send button
send text "Send message"
send inside section

make footer
footer inside page
footer text "Ine — form experiment"

say page title